      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Literature has suggested that the facet joint is responsible for at least some low back pain. This article discusses the history, neuroanatomy, pain formation in the joints, definition of facet syndrome, diagnostics, therapy, a review of the literature, and complications of facet coagulation."},
